*** Test Cases ***
### SA

[1]CB011028_D_01_IWK_with_10544_UE_Power_Saving
    [Documentation]
    ...  == DESCRIPTION ==
    ...  - Test case purpose is to verify behavior of BWP configurations with PRB Pooling scenarios when RACH is not present in the
    ...  Power saving BWP.
    ...  - UEs supporting PS-BWP are configured with PS-BWP without RACH config.
    ...  - The test verify behavior of BWP configurations with PRB Pooling scenarios when RACH is not present in the
    ...    Power saving BWP. UEs supporting PS-BWP are configured with PS-BWP without RACH config.
    ...
    ...
    ...  == PRECONDITION ==
    ...  - gNB2 classical - real hardware - ASOE with simulated 4x AEQE
    ...  - AMF1 simulated
    ...  - Airphone simulator configured for SA mode
    ...  - NR cells are up and connected to AMF1
    ...  - gNB2 up and running with 4 SANSA TDD cells (band n78)
    ...  - GNB is configured with profile CB006915-N#1 CFG#4
    ...    CFG#4	"Three cells are configured on each BB board -
    ...              4x100MHz 8DL-4UL streams NR TDD FR1 BF cell"
    ...              Cell1 & Cell3 in L1PoolId10 / L1SubPool1
    ...              Cell2 & Cell4 in L1PoolId10 / L1SubPool2
    ...  - CB009890 is activated
    ...  - NRCELL-1.chBw = 100Mz
    ...  - NRCELL-1.cellTechnology = TDD
    ...  - NRCELL-1.actPowerSavingBWP = true
    ...  - NRCELL-1.actInitialBWPFlexibility = true
    ...  - NRCELL-1.nrarfcn = 636666
    ...  - NRCELL-1.gscnOrSsPbchArfcn = 7864
    ...  - NRCELL-1.msg1FrequencyStart = 120
    ...   (NRCELL-1.msg1frequencyStart is outside range <cRbStartUl, cRbStartUl+cRbSizeUl> of the BWP_PROFILE-50 (RACH is outside the PS-BWP, >106))
    ...   (NRCELL-1.msg1frequencyStart is inside range <cRbStartUl, cRbStartUl+cRbSizeUl> of the BWP_PROFILE-5 (RACH is inside the initial BWP, <162))
    ...  - NRCELL-1.ueConnectionEstablishmentMode = useDedicatedBwp
    ...  - NRCELL-1.cellBwpList =
    ...    - cellBwpId: '0'
    ...      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-5'     initial BWP - 60MHZ, BWP#0
    ...    - cellBwpId: '1'
    ...      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-44'    default dedicated BWP - 100MHZ, BWP#1
    ...    - cellBwpId: '2'
    ...      bwpDN: 'MRBTS-1/NRBTS-1/BWP_PROFILE-50'    Power Saving BWP - 40MHZ, BWP#2
    ...
    ...
    ...  - NRBTS-1.actMultipleDedicatedBWPs = false
    ...  - NRBTS-1.dlRateThresholdFromPsBwp = 350
    ...  - NRBTS-1.dlRateThresholdToPsBwp = 300
    ...
    ...
    ...  - TDD Frame Structure is set to semi static
    ...     NRBTS/NRCELL/tddFrameStructure. frameStructureType = semiStatic
    ...     NRBTS/NRCELL/tddFrameStructure. guardPeriodLength = 2Symbols
    ...     NRBTS/NRCELL/tddFrameStructure. ulDlDataSlotRatio = 3/7
    ...     actDlSrsBm is activated
    ...     srsForBeamMgmt at Cell level
    ...       <list name="srsForBeamMgmt">
    ...       <item>
    ...       <p name="bSRS">2</p>
    ...       <p name="cSRS">63</p>
    ...       <p name="srsPowerThresholdForDlBm">-1200</p>
    ...       <p name="srsTypeAllocForDlBm">antenna switching or codebook</p>
    ...       <p name="srsUePeriodicity">slots40</p>
    ...       </item>
    ...       </list>
    ...       actUeCsirsCoexistCellCsirs = TRUE
    ...       In egate, you need to activate the Srs mode : cfg file modified by KW
    ...         Update Basic Configuration File for actDlSrsBm Test Mode
    ...             cell_srs_beam_pos_nr profile_id=1 num_of_ue_positions=4 azimuth=-70,-19,20,70
    ...             cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=1 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...             cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=2 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...             cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=3 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...
    ...    - Test with 5 Ues  (2Ues for Cell1 and 1ue per Cell for Cell2,3,4)
    ...      Ue1, Ue3 and Ue5 ue_srs_beam_pos init_pos0 srsMode=fixed
    ...      Ue2, Ue4 and Ue6 ue_srs_beam_pos init_pos3 srsMode=fixed
    ...
    ...  == TESTING TOOLS ==
    ...    AirPhone, EPCSIM, UTE
    ...
    ...  == TEST ENVIRONMENT ==
    ...  - gNB classicBTS in SANSA mode
    ...  - HARDWARE ID:  gNB(ASOE) with 4 simulated AEQE radio modules
    ...  - UE configured in SA, TDD,
    ...
    ...  == Checks / Verdict ==
    ...  - Based on TtiTraces, Check that nb of dlSubCell per L1pool and L1Spool dont exceed maxNumDlSubcellL1Pool and maxNumDlSubcellL1Sp
    ...         defined in Vendor File\n
    ...           NRBTS\bbPoolCapacity\maxNumDlSubcellL1Pool for ASOE: 6
    ...           NRBTS\bbPoolCapacity\maxNumDlSubcellL1Sp for ASOE: 4
    ...  - Based on TtiTraces (dlTdSchedSubcellData.numAllocCellPrbDl), check prbstreamcapa as expected for subpool1 and subpoll2
    ...  - Based on Sherpa Traces, Check NumMinPrbAlloc and NumMaxPrbAlloc in Dl PrbPoolingAllocationReport for spool0 and spool1
    ...  - Based on Sherpa Traces, Verification of Stream PRB Information within PRB Pooling Report for spool0 and spool1
    ...  - Calls for multi ues and PRB pooling are passed / no Dtx / no Dl Bler
    [Tags]  CRT
    Set To Dictionary       ${C_Cell}    totalNbOfUe       5
    TC CB011028-D PS BWP switch scenario  ${C_Cell}    ${dictParam}    ${Vendor_IWK_CB8940-L_CB7113}    ${dict_settings_all_ues}    nrCell=3
    ...          kw Set RAD Params=Set RAD Params for 11028-D
    ...          kw NIDD Set=Set CB009890-A NIDD PARAMETERS with dlMUMIMO
    ...          kw NIDD Check=Check CB009890-A NIDD PARAMETERS with dlMUMIMO
    ...          kw Set TestMode=Update Basic Configuration File for actDlSrsBm Test Mode with azimuth=-70,-19,20,70 for 4cells
    ...          kw Specific Set TestMode Before Attach=Override and Activate Ue SRS Beam pos profile 2 for all ${C_Cell.totalNbOfUe} Ues
    ...          kw Specific Set TestMode After Attach=Override and Activate UE CSI profile for all ${C_Cell.totalNbOfUe} Ues
    ...          NIDD_11028_PARAMS=${NIDD_11028_w_CB008940_CB007113_DLMIMO_PARAMS_ASOE}
    ...          kw Specific Check=Check RimRs CB011028 Based l1L2 Bip
    ...          kw Check SCF parameters=verify_SCF_Paramaters
    ...          Kw TestLine Preparation=TL_Preparation_CB011028_SCF_CB006915_CFG_1_4Cells_woBSR_wRIMRs_wPSBWP
    ...          Json test configuration=${relative_json_path}

# test vendor file
#      [setup]    Run Keywords     Create log path Folder
#      ...        AND              Create Test Suite Folder
#      ...        AND              set Suite Variable    ${testCaseDir}    None
#      ...        AND              Get testcase log directory
#      ...        AND              Prepare Test Name
#     ${filter}     set Variable    bbHwVariant=ASOE&&csSize=48&&direction=DL&&l1PoolType=NR_L1_Loki_TDD_FR1_eCPRI_IQF_Symm
#     @{PARAMS_IN_VENDOR}    Create List
#     ...     bbL1SpPrbInitCapacity:maxNumLayerPrbL1Sp=1600|${filter}
#     ...     bbL1SpPrbInitCapacity:maxNumStreamPrbL1Sp=1600|${filter}
#     # set test variable     ${test_scf_file}     /home/ute/csamson/TRACES/SCF.xml
#     CB011028-D-Keywords.Deploy Vendor File to activate CB011028    vendor_param=${PARAMS_IN_VENDOR}
#     ...                                                            is_perform_full_commissioning=${False}

*** Keywords ***

Set CB011028-D NIDD PARAMETERS with ulMUMIMO
    [Arguments]    ${list}=${NIDD_11028_D_w_CB008940_CB007113_PARAMS_ASOE}
    Set CB009890 NIDD PARAMETERS VERSION 3     ${list}
    ${test_scf_file}             OAM Get SCF File            dir=${LOG_PATH}      file=SCF.xml
    Set Suite Variable           ${test_scf_file}

Check CB011028-D NIDD PARAMETERS with ulMUMIMO
   [Arguments]    ${list}=${NIDD_11028_D_w_CB008940_CB007113_PARAMS_ASOE}
